{"page":477,"width":1670,"height":2456,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"538","words":[{"text":"538","x":175,"y":140,"width":56,"height":26}]},{"text":"Chapter 12 입출력 시스템","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":298,"y":143,"width":112,"height":26},{"text":"12","x":422,"y":143,"width":34,"height":21},{"text":"입출력","x":483,"y":142,"width":61,"height":25},{"text":"시스템","x":553,"y":143,"width":60,"height":23}]},{"text":"는 호스트 버스 어댑터대BA)로 구현된다. 일반적으로 FC 프로토콜 메시지를 처리할","words":[{"text":"는","x":298,"y":260,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"호스트","x":342,"y":259,"width":89,"height":28},{"text":"버스","x":447,"y":258,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"어댑터대BA)로","x":518,"y":258,"width":210,"height":37},{"text":"구현된다.","x":743,"y":260,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"일반적으로","x":885,"y":261,"width":149,"height":34},{"text":"FC","x":1049,"y":264,"width":43,"height":27},{"text":"프로토콜","x":1110,"y":262,"width":129,"height":31},{"text":"메시지를","x":1256,"y":260,"width":131,"height":34},{"text":"처리할","x":1406,"y":258,"width":92,"height":34}]},{"text":"수 있는 프로세서, 마이크로코드 및 일부 전용 메모리가 포힘서어 있다. 일부 장치는 자","words":[{"text":"수","x":297,"y":314,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":342,"y":314,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"프로세서,","x":411,"y":315,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"마이크로코드","x":547,"y":314,"width":173,"height":35},{"text":"및","x":733,"y":315,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"일부","x":774,"y":315,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"전용","x":845,"y":315,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"메모리가","x":914,"y":316,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"포힘서어","x":1048,"y":315,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1191,"y":315,"width":70,"height":34},{"text":"일부","x":1280,"y":316,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"장치는","x":1358,"y":314,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"자","x":1469,"y":314,"width":30,"height":33}]},{"text":"체 컨트를러를 내장하고 있다. 디스크 드라이브를 보면 한쪽에 회로 기판이 부착되어 있","words":[{"text":"체","x":298,"y":369,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"컨트를러를","x":340,"y":370,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"내장하고","x":497,"y":370,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":624,"y":369,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":700,"y":370,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"드라이브를","x":797,"y":370,"width":148,"height":34},{"text":"보면","x":957,"y":371,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"한쪽에","x":1030,"y":371,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"회로","x":1137,"y":370,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"기판이","x":1216,"y":371,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"부착되어","x":1326,"y":369,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"있","x":1471,"y":369,"width":28,"height":34}]},{"text":"는 것을 볼수 있다. 이 보드는 디스크 컨트롤러이다. 예를 들어, SAS 및 SATA와 같은","words":[{"text":"는","x":295,"y":427,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"것을","x":339,"y":425,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"볼수","x":408,"y":426,"width":71,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":492,"y":426,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":569,"y":425,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"보드는","x":608,"y":427,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"디스크","x":708,"y":425,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"컨트롤러이다.","x":806,"y":425,"width":183,"height":35},{"text":"예를","x":1006,"y":426,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"들어,","x":1079,"y":426,"width":70,"height":34},{"text":"SAS","x":1164,"y":429,"width":69,"height":27},{"text":"및","x":1250,"y":426,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"SATA와","x":1294,"y":426,"width":132,"height":33},{"text":"같은","x":1438,"y":425,"width":62,"height":33}]},{"text":"컴퓨터와 디스크를 연계시기기 위한 프로토콜의 디스크 측 부분을 구현한다. 불량 섹터","words":[{"text":"컴퓨터와","x":296,"y":481,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"디스크를","x":428,"y":481,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"연계시기기","x":556,"y":481,"width":139,"height":34},{"text":"위한","x":712,"y":481,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"프로토콜의","x":781,"y":481,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"디스크","x":942,"y":481,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"측","x":1045,"y":482,"width":32,"height":32},{"text":"부분을","x":1090,"y":482,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"구현한다.","x":1201,"y":482,"width":140,"height":34},{"text":"불량","x":1358,"y":482,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"섹터","x":1438,"y":481,"width":58,"height":34}]},{"text":"매핑, 선반입, 버퍼링 및 개성과 같은 많은 작업을 수행하는 마이크로코드 및 프로세서가","words":[{"text":"매핑,","x":294,"y":536,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"선반입,","x":373,"y":537,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"버퍼링","x":481,"y":538,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"및","x":578,"y":538,"width":25,"height":33},{"text":"개성과","x":617,"y":537,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"같은","x":713,"y":537,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"많은","x":781,"y":537,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"작업을","x":850,"y":536,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"수행하는","x":949,"y":537,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"마이크로코드","x":1085,"y":537,"width":196,"height":34},{"text":"및","x":1296,"y":538,"width":28,"height":33},{"text":"프로세서가","x":1339,"y":537,"width":163,"height":34}]},{"text":"있다.","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":293,"y":592,"width":65,"height":34}]},{"text":"12.2.1 메모리 탭드 입출력 Memory-Mapped 1/0","words":[{"text":"12.2.1","x":289,"y":696,"width":123,"height":29},{"text":"메모리","x":453,"y":698,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"탭드","x":544,"y":698,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"입출력","x":608,"y":697,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"Memory-Mapped","x":709,"y":705,"width":240,"height":25},{"text":"1/0","x":957,"y":705,"width":41,"height":21}]},{"text":"입출력 전송을 하기 위해 처리기는 어떻게 명령어와 데이터를 컨트롤러에 전달하는가?","words":[{"text":"입출력","x":290,"y":763,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"전송을","x":394,"y":765,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"하기","x":494,"y":766,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"위해","x":566,"y":765,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"처리기는","x":637,"y":765,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"어떻게","x":766,"y":765,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"명령어와","x":867,"y":766,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"데이터를","x":1002,"y":767,"width":125,"height":33},{"text":"컨트롤러에","x":1144,"y":767,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"전달하는가?","x":1325,"y":768,"width":176,"height":33}]},{"text":"대답은 간단하다. 모든 컨트롤러는 (제어용 또는 데이터용) 레지스터를 가지고 있다. 본","words":[{"text":"대답은","x":288,"y":819,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"간단하다.","x":391,"y":821,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":528,"y":823,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"컨트롤러는","x":601,"y":821,"width":143,"height":34},{"text":"(제어용","x":756,"y":821,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"또는","x":867,"y":824,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"데이터용)","x":941,"y":823,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"레지스터를","x":1091,"y":824,"width":164,"height":33},{"text":"가지고","x":1269,"y":824,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1386,"y":824,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"본","x":1471,"y":825,"width":32,"height":31}]},{"text":"체의 프로세서는 이들 컨트롤러의 레지스터에 비트 패턴을 쓰거나 읽음으로써 입출력을","words":[{"text":"체의","x":288,"y":875,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"프로세서는","x":358,"y":877,"width":149,"height":33},{"text":"이들","x":519,"y":877,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"컨트롤러의","x":589,"y":877,"width":140,"height":35},{"text":"레지스터에","x":744,"y":877,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"비트","x":905,"y":879,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"패턴을","x":976,"y":879,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"쓰거나","x":1081,"y":880,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"읽음으로써","x":1194,"y":880,"width":162,"height":34},{"text":"입출력을","x":1376,"y":880,"width":127,"height":33}]},{"text":"수행한다. 이러한 통신을 수행하는 한 방법은 “특별한 입출력 명령어”를 시용하는 것이","words":[{"text":"수행한다.","x":286,"y":932,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"이러한","x":429,"y":933,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"통신을","x":528,"y":933,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"수행하는","x":627,"y":933,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":757,"y":934,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"방법은","x":800,"y":934,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"“특별한","x":903,"y":935,"width":104,"height":33},{"text":"입출력","x":1023,"y":935,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"명령어”를","x":1131,"y":936,"width":146,"height":33},{"text":"시용하는","x":1291,"y":936,"width":135,"height":34},{"text":"것이","x":1441,"y":935,"width":58,"height":34}]},{"text":"다. 이들 입출력 명령어는 한 바이트나 워드를 어떤 입출력 포트 주소로 전달하도록 지","words":[{"text":"다.","x":286,"y":989,"width":37,"height":33},{"text":"이들","x":339,"y":989,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"입출력","x":412,"y":989,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"명령어는","x":512,"y":989,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":638,"y":989,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"바이트나","x":680,"y":989,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"워드를","x":812,"y":990,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"어떤","x":915,"y":991,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"입출력","x":991,"y":991,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"포트","x":1096,"y":995,"width":66,"height":25},{"text":"주소로","x":1176,"y":994,"width":100,"height":32},{"text":"전달하도록","x":1293,"y":992,"width":165,"height":33},{"text":"지","x":1473,"y":992,"width":25,"height":33}]},{"text":"정한다. 입출력 명령은 해당 장치에 맞는 버스 회선을 선택하여 장치 레지스터로 비트들","words":[{"text":"정한다.","x":288,"y":1045,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"입출력","x":397,"y":1045,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"명령은","x":496,"y":1045,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"해당","x":592,"y":1045,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"장치에","x":661,"y":1045,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"맞는","x":760,"y":1046,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"버스","x":832,"y":1046,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"회선을","x":904,"y":1047,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"선택하여","x":1008,"y":1047,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"장치","x":1146,"y":1048,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"레지스터로","x":1226,"y":1048,"width":168,"height":34},{"text":"비트들","x":1408,"y":1048,"width":95,"height":32}]},{"text":"을 보내거나 읽어 으드록 촉발한다. 다른 방법으로 이러한 특수 입출력 명령어를 가지는","words":[{"text":"을","x":285,"y":1102,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"보내거나","x":327,"y":1102,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"읽어","x":458,"y":1101,"width":52,"height":34},{"text":"으드록","x":524,"y":1102,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"촉발한다.","x":621,"y":1101,"width":124,"height":33},{"text":"다른","x":760,"y":1101,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"방법으로","x":830,"y":1103,"width":122,"height":32},{"text":"이러한","x":965,"y":1103,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"특수","x":1068,"y":1105,"width":66,"height":32},{"text":"입출력","x":1149,"y":1104,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"명령어를","x":1261,"y":1105,"width":133,"height":33},{"text":"가지는","x":1408,"y":1104,"width":95,"height":34}]},{"text":"대신 장치 제어 레지스터를 프로세서의 주소 공간으로 시상한다. 이러한 방식이 메모리","words":[{"text":"대신","x":286,"y":1158,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"장치","x":358,"y":1158,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"제어","x":429,"y":1158,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"레지스터를","x":500,"y":1157,"width":143,"height":34},{"text":"프로세서의","x":654,"y":1157,"width":145,"height":35},{"text":"주소","x":815,"y":1160,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"공간으로","x":888,"y":1159,"width":123,"height":32},{"text":"시상한다.","x":1024,"y":1160,"width":136,"height":34},{"text":"이러한","x":1179,"y":1161,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"방식이","x":1293,"y":1161,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"메모리","x":1407,"y":1159,"width":92,"height":34}]},{"text":"맵드 입출력(memory-mapped I/O) 방식이다. 이 경우 각 주변 장치 레지스터들은 메","words":[{"text":"맵드","x":286,"y":1214,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"입출력(memory-mapped","x":357,"y":1214,"width":353,"height":38},{"text":"I/O)","x":722,"y":1216,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"방식이다.","x":804,"y":1214,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":946,"y":1216,"width":25,"height":32},{"text":"경우","x":988,"y":1216,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"각","x":1060,"y":1216,"width":33,"height":33},{"text":"주변","x":1104,"y":1217,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"장치","x":1181,"y":1217,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"레지스터들은","x":1262,"y":1217,"width":200,"height":35},{"text":"메","x":1473,"y":1217,"width":27,"height":33}]},{"text":"모리 주소와 일대일 대응된다. CPU는 물리 메모리에 사상된 장치-제어 레지스터를 읽","words":[{"text":"모리","x":284,"y":1270,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"주소와","x":355,"y":1271,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"일대일","x":457,"y":1269,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"대응된다.","x":552,"y":1269,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"CPU는","x":688,"y":1271,"width":101,"height":31},{"text":"물리","x":800,"y":1270,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"메모리에","x":874,"y":1270,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"사상된","x":1008,"y":1272,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"장치-제어","x":111